    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Groups + Roguelike + Match-3</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero went missing during a mission, and the demon race is about to strike again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to find the hero as soon as possible and uncover the mastermind behind the scenes from any clues you can gather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge loot during the rescue process</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will feature over 100 relics and 80 runestones, with different effects obtained through combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/8083d8226a8249b22dfe75f9fcf5b912.poster.avif?t=1749527467\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/8083d8226a8249b22dfe75f9fcf5b912.webm?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/8083d8226a8249b22dfe75f9fcf5b912.mp4?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn character extra skills at the camp</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 5 available characters has 2 initial skills and 6 enhancement skills; choose suitable ones to further boost your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/a6007521d78c07a076a4eed3d7a03701.poster.avif?t=1749527467\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/a6007521d78c07a076a4eed3d7a03701.webm?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/a6007521d78c07a076a4eed3d7a03701.mp4?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat powerful enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll encounter various obstacles. Defeat them, find the hero, and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/1e4e2afe174cf2cca4ff6f9b0ebfb465.poster.avif?t=1749527467\" width=640 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/1e4e2afe174cf2cca4ff6f9b0ebfb465.webm?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/1e4e2afe174cf2cca4ff6f9b0ebfb465.mp4?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Groups + Roguelike + Match-3</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero went missing during a mission, and the demon race is about to strike again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to find the hero as soon as possible and uncover the mastermind behind the scenes from any clues you can gather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scavenge loot during the rescue process</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will feature over 100 relics and 80 runestones, with different effects obtained through combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/8083d8226a8249b22dfe75f9fcf5b912.poster.avif?t=1749527467\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/8083d8226a8249b22dfe75f9fcf5b912.webm?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/8083d8226a8249b22dfe75f9fcf5b912.mp4?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn character extra skills at the camp</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 5 available characters has 2 initial skills and 6 enhancement skills; choose suitable ones to further boost your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/a6007521d78c07a076a4eed3d7a03701.poster.avif?t=1749527467\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/a6007521d78c07a076a4eed3d7a03701.webm?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/a6007521d78c07a076a4eed3d7a03701.mp4?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defeat powerful enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll encounter various obstacles. Defeat them, find the hero, and uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/1e4e2afe174cf2cca4ff6f9b0ebfb465.poster.avif?t=1749527467\" width=640 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/1e4e2afe174cf2cca4ff6f9b0ebfb465.webm?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535770/extras/1e4e2afe174cf2cca4ff6f9b0ebfb465.mp4?t=1749527467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Rescue Quest is a single-player game that combines team-building, Roguelike elements, and match-three mechanics. Hero have gone missing, and the demons is about to strike again. Your task is to find the heroes as quickly as possible and uncover the mastermind behind it all from the clues.",
